 for Stephens County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, March to April hit 307% of normal on the middle, and September to October fell to 50%. Grid 17528 had its driest year in 2011 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
